# NOTE: public/build is intentionally TRACKED — the VPS deploy pulls committed
# assets (no `npm run build` on the server). Do not re-ignore it, or rebuilt
# hashed files (app-*.css/js) won't be pushed and every page 404s its styles.
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
# DB dumps / backups must never be committed (contain user rows, hashes, sessions)
/storage/backups/
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.dump
/vendor
